{"step_index":955,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:12:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-23T09:12:05+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-23T09:12:06+09:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n=== CHECKING PLACEHOLDERS AND HYPHENS ACROSS ALL CELLS ===\nFound 12 placeholder cells:\nRow 254 [신예락] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 692 [메리데브] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 916 [액트온게임] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1517 [페이크스튜디오] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1519 [타이니넵] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1585 [도약민] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1656 [투디픽스] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1657 [프로토팩토리] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1661 [오드볼게임즈] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1834 [트윈채리엇] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 1935 [데이터스피라] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\nRow 2083 [하드롤(HARDROLL)] Col 16 (24년 매출액(원)): [-]\n\n"}
{"step_index":956,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:12:11Z","thinking":"The user wants to remove invalid phone numbers and clear placeholder data, specifically the `[-]` entries. It seems the \"없는 데이터 다 지워라\" instruction applies more broadly to any data the user deems \"missing.\" Proceed to implement the deletion and the fill in the appropriate locations.\n\n\nEmpty cells, particularly those containing placeholders or representing missing data, require a specific handling approach. Missing sales data marked with `[-]` will be cleared to true empty cells, then highlighted. Initial assessment reveals 254 missing phone numbers, 222 empty '사업자번호', 15 empty '대표자 성함', 7 empty '주소' cells, and 12 sales cells using `[-]`.\n\nThe instruction \"Fill missing data with brown color\" applies to all identified missing data including empty phone numbers, placeholder sales data, and missing core information fields. If phone numbers and one of the core fields are simultaneously missing for the same row, then the entire row will be marked (갈색 채우기).\n\n\nInitial assessment suggests considering Excel's Korean color palette for \"갈색.\" Identified several candidate colors within the palette, including `#F8CBAD`, `#EDBB99`, and `#F4E7D7`. Determined to clarify the user's color preference by checking prior usage within the target Excel file.\n\nExamination of the Excel file reveals that \"파란색\" (blue) was used to refer to cells with a specific theme color and tint, which corresponds to \"Accent 5\" (Theme 8). Deducted, if \"파란색\" refers to Theme 8, the user likely refers to \"Accent 2\" (Theme 5) by saying \"갈색\".\n\n\nTheme color mapping in the Excel file confirms a specific color theme associated with \"갈색\". Identified the equivalent \"갈색\" color for `theme: 5` as `#F8CBAD`, corresponding to `tint: 0.6`. This specific theme and tint will be used to fill the missing phone number cells. The '[-]' placeholders will be removed from sales data. The phone number data will be assessed to determine invalid entries.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst xlsx = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_undo_game_studio/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nfunction parseCSV(content) {\n  const rows = [];\n  let currentRow = [];\n  let currentField = '';\n  let inQuotes = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < content.length; i++) {\n    const char = content[i];\n    const nextChar = content[i + 1];\n    if (char === '\"') {\n      if (inQuotes && nextChar === '\"') {\n        currentField += '\"';\n        i++;\n      } else {\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n      }\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      currentField = '';\n    } else if ((char === '\\r' || char === '\\n') && !inQuotes) {\n      if (char === '\\r' && nextChar === '\\n') i++;\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n      currentRow = [];\n      currentField = '';\n    } else {\n      currentField += char;\n    }\n  }\n  if (currentField !== '' || currentRow.length > 0) {\n    currentRow.push(currentField);\n    if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n  }\n  return rows;\n}\n\nfunction toCSVLine(fields) {\n  return fields.map(f => {\n    if (f === null || f === undefined) return '';\n    const str = String(f);\n    if (str.includes(',') || str.includes('\"') || str.includes('\\n') || str.includes('\\r')) {\n      return `\"${str.replace(/\"/g, '\"\"')}\"`;\n    }\n    return str;\n  }).join(',');\n}\n\nasync function applyBrownFillsAndClean() {\n  const dir = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today';\n  const targetXlsx = path.join(dir, '(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명_최종제출본.xlsx');\n  const targetCsv = path.join(dir, '(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명_최종제출본.csv');\n  const primaryCsv = path.join(dir, '(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.csv');\n\n  console.log('Reading final master Excel...');\n  const wb = new xlsx.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(targetXlsx);\n  const wsCorp = wb.getWorksheet('기업체 리스트');\n\n  // Brown fill definition: Theme 5 (Accent 2, Brown/Orange) tint 0.6 (Soft Warm Brown / Tan #F8CBAD)\n  const brownFill = {\n    type: 'pattern',\n    pattern: 'solid',\n    fgColor: { argb: 'FFF8CBAD' } // Soft Warm Tan / Brown\n  };\n\n  const brownBorder = {\n    top: { style: 'thin', color: { argb: 'FFED7D31' } },\n    bottom: { style: 'thin', color: { argb: 'FFED7D31' } },\n    left: { style: 'thin', color: { argb: 'FFED7D31' } },\n    right: { style: 'thin', color: { argb: 'FFED7D31' } }\n  };\n\n  let phoneBrownCount = 0;\n  let bizBrownCount = 0;\n  let ceoBrownCount = 0;\n  let addrBrownCount = 0;\n  let salesHyphenClearedCount = 0;\n\n  for (let r = 2; r <= wsCorp.rowCount; r++) {\n    const row = wsCorp.getRow(r);\n\n    // 1. Phone (Col 8 in Excel: 연락처)\n    const phoneCell = row.getCell(8);\n    const phoneVal = phoneCell.value ? String(phoneCell.value).trim() : '';\n    if (!phoneVal || phoneVal === '-' || phoneVal === '없음') {\n      phoneCell.value = '';\n      phoneCell.fill = brownFill;\n      phoneCell.border = brownBorder;\n      phoneBrownCount++;\n    }\n\n    // 2. Biz Number (Col 4 in Excel: 사업자번호)\n    const bizCell = row.getCell(4);\n    const bizVal = bizCell.value ? String(bizCell.value).trim() : '';\n    if (!bizVal || bizVal === '-' || bizVal === '없음') {\n      bizCell.value = '';\n      bizCell.fill = brownFill;\n      bizCell.border = brownBorder;\n      bizBrownCount++;\n    }\n\n    // 3. CEO (Col 7 in Excel: 대표자 성함)\n    const ceoCell = row.getCell(7);\n    const ceoVal = ceoCell.value ? String(ceoCell.value).trim() : '';\n    if (!ceoVal || ceoVal === '-' || ceoVal === '없음') {\n      ceoCell.value = '';\n      ceoCell.fill = brownFill;\n      ceoCell.border = brownBorder;\n      ceoBrownCount++;\n    }\n\n    // 4. Address (Col 11 in Excel: 주소)\n    const addrCell = row.getCell(11);\n    const addrVal = addrCell.value ? String(addrCell.value).trim() : '';\n    if (!addrVal || addrVal === '-' || addrVal === '없음') {\n      addrCell.value = '';\n      addrCell.fill = brownFill;\n      addrCell.border = brownBorder;\n      addrBrownCount++;\n    }\n\n    // 5. Sales 24 (Col 17) and Sales 25 (Col 18) - Clean hyphens '[-]'\n    [17, 18].forEach(colIdx => {\n      const salesCell = row.getCell(colIdx);\n      const sVal = salesCell.value ? String(salesCell.value).trim() : '';\n      if (sVal === '-' || sVal === '--') {\n        salesCell.value = '';\n        salesCell.fill = brownFill;\n        salesCell.border = brownBorder;\n        salesHyphenClearedCount++;\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  console.log('=== BROWN FILL & CLEANING APPLIED ===');\n  console.log(`1. 전화번호 없는 셀 갈색 채우기: ${phoneBrownCount}개`);\n  console.log(`2. 사업자번호 없는 셀 갈색 채우기: ${bizBrownCount}개`);\n  console.log(`3. 대표자명 없는 셀 갈색 채우기: ${ceoBrownCount}개`);\n  console.log(`4. 주소 없는 셀 갈색 채우기: ${addrBrownCount}개`);\n  console.log(`5. 매출액 결측치[-] 제거 및 갈색 채우기: ${salesHyphenClearedCount}개`);\n  const totalBrownCells = phoneBrownCount + bizBrownCount + ceoBrownCount + addrBrownCount + salesHyphenClearedCount;\n  console.log(`총 갈색 음영 채우기 완료 셀: ${totalBrownCells}개`);\n\n  // Save updated Excel file\n  await wb.xlsx.writeFile(targetXlsx);\n  console.log(`Saved updated Excel to: ${targetXlsx}`);\n\n  // Also update CSV to clear the '[-]' placeholders so data is 100% clean\n  const csvContent = fs.readFileSync(targetCsv, 'utf8');\n  const cleanCsvContent = csvContent.charCodeAt(0) === 0xFEFF ? csvContent.slice(1) : csvContent;\n  const csvRows = parseCSV(cleanCsvContent);\n  const updatedCsvData = csvRows.slice(1).map(r => {\n    // Col 16 & Col 17: if '-', set to ''\n    if (r[16] && r[16].trim() === '-') r[16] = '';\n    if (r[17] && r[17].trim() === '-') r[17] = '';\n    return r;\n  });\n\n  const finalCsvLines = [\n    toCSVLine(csvRows[0]),\n    ...updatedCsvData.map(r => toCSVLine(r))\n  ];\n  const finalCsvStr = '\\uFEFF' + finalCsvLines.join('\\r\\n') + '\\r\\n';\n  fs.writeFileSync(targetCsv, finalCsvStr, 'utf8');\n  fs.writeFileSync(primaryCsv, finalCsvStr, 'utf8');\n  console.log('Synchronized updated CSVs.');\n}\n\napplyBrownFillsAndClean().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Apply brown fills to missing data and clean placeholders","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\apply_brown_fills.js","toolAction":"Write apply_brown_fills.js","toolSummary":"Write apply_brown_fills.js"}}]}
